re Salamander Cave</b> is located just outside the city boundary of Venore near the south gate, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32924,32148,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32924, 32148, 7)</a>. It has a hunting floor at level -2 which connects various caves laying one floor deeper.\n</p><p>With the implementation of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Imbuing\">imbuing system</a>, some creatures products such as Damselfly Wing and Piece of Swampling Wood are a good way to make money for low levels.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Creatures</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Salamander\"><img alt=\"Salamander\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Salamander_b64893.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Salamander\">Salamander</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">25</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">70</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">11 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Earth Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poisoned_Icon_7605e0.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>0-15× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>0-5× Insectoid Eggs (common)</li>\n<li>0-3× <a href=\"#/wiki/Arrow\">Arrow</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"